WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.519
Verify a deed copy.

2
00:00:01.519 --> 00:00:06.780
If someone gives you a copy of a deed, check whether it matches the recorded deed.

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.320
We do not keep the file.

4
00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:09.917
Step 1.

5
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:11.383
Choose the copy.

6
00:00:11.383 --> 00:00:15.416
On Verify a deed copy, press the file field.

7
00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:19.083
Use a phone photo or a PDF, up to 10 MB.

8
00:00:20.038 --> 00:00:20.611
Step 2.

9
00:00:20.611 --> 00:00:22.086
Press Verify copy.

10
00:00:22.086 --> 00:00:25.691
When the file name shows, press Verify copy.

11
00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:28.394
The answer comes within a minute.

12
00:00:29.351 --> 00:00:29.851
Step 3.

13
00:00:29.851 --> 00:00:30.993
Read the result.

14
00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:34.706
If it does not match, the result lists what differs.

15
00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:38.276
Even on a match, confirm with the registry office.
